  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Community Policing and Transitional Justice to Promote Stabilisation in Iraq (Phase IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to positioning the state as the primary guarantor of safety, security and justice in Iraq. Through this, it aims to 1) promote a conducive environment for returns through strengthened social cohesion and increasing access to rights and political representation and; 2) enhance peace, security and stability by rebuilding trust between law enforcement officials and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
